# Events for the automatic run of graphics_test on GNOME under X11: see
# doc/auto_events.md, and tests/event/graphics_test.evt, whose events these are.
# The syncs are this system's: the font list test pages through the installed
# fonts, of which there are eight pages more here than on the system the
# common file was taken on, so every pattern after it is eight frames on.

# The real keyboard, mouse and joystick are set aside for the run
keyboardoff
mouseoff
joystickoff

# Graphical scrolling test: the arrows scroll the grid, ten steps each way
sync 154
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
up
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
down
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
left
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
right
enter

# Graphical mouse movement test: the mouse draws a box and a diagonal
sync 155
moumovg 1 200 200
moumovg 1 1100 200
moumovg 1 1100 700
moumovg 1 200 700
moumovg 1 200 200
moumovg 1 1100 700
enter

# View drawing scale test: zoom in twice and out once, pan left, right, up
# and down
sync 159
pagu
pagu
pagd
left
left
right
up
up
down
enter
